Name: Claude Code Chat
Description: Open a project-rooted, agentic Claude Code chat (ClaudeAgentSDK) in the RStudio Viewer. The active file and selection are used as context; file edits/shell commands are approval-gated.
Binding: claude_addin
Interactive: true

Name: Claude Workspace
Description: Open one Claude Code workspace across multiple saved projects, with project-routed sessions and up to four concurrent threads.
Binding: claude_workspace_addin
Interactive: true
